# Build-time image derivatives. scripts/optimise-raster-images.mjs writes a sibling
# .webp next to any public/images/**/*.{png,jpg,jpeg} over its size threshold; that
# script's own header explains they are generated rather than committed, and
# Cloudflare Pages regenerates them on every deploy. Without these lines every local
# `npm run build` leaves an untracked file and git-hygiene checks ask for it.
# Add a line per new large raster source. Hand-authored .webp images are SOURCES —
# they stay tracked and must never be listed here.
public/images/team/madiha-shahid.webp
public/images/team/rahul-van-manen.webp
